<title>CHINA: Perwaja Terengganu sets US$400 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Perwaja Terengganu sets US$400 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Standard Chartered Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER  PERWAJA TERENGGANU SDN BHD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR GOVERNMENT OF MALAYSIA</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$400 MLN  COUPON     LIBOR+22BP MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	  CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES   07.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING   --	    REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    $500K</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   ENGLISH/MALAYSIAN		     HOME CTRY MALAYSIA</p>
<p> FEES	5.0BP FOR PARTICIPANTS COMMITTING US$10 MLN AND ABOVE</p>
<p> ARRANGER	 STANDARD CHARTERED BANK</p>
<p> CO-ARRANGERS   J.P. MORGAN SECURITIES ASIA, DKB ASIA, IBJ ASIA</p>
<p>		    AND DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL</p>
<p> NOTE	     PROCEEDS WILL BE USED FOR RE-FINANCING EXISTING</p>
<p>DEBTS</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
